<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- A head-and-shoulders portrait in PetPalette colours, sized so the hair,
     the ahoge and the bow all sit inside the 66dp safe zone: a full body
     loses its hands and feet to the mask.

     Redrawn with the character: silver hair rather than violet twin tails,
     amber eyes, and — the change that matters most at 48dp — the same dark
     contour every form in the app is now inked with. A flat silhouette on a
     dark background is what made the old icon read as a smudge in a tray. -->
